# ORM28 精确 SQL 复合外键清单

仅此有限清单提出数据库特有差异分类，分类由 Root 在实际 schema diff 后裁定。每项实际规则仍保留在 PostgreSQL，候选不会创建较弱的单列 FK；禁止通过忽略整个表、所有 FK 或名称前缀来放行。catalogValidated 是输入 catalog25 的观察值，不是本作者重新连接验证。

Mikro 7 的 relation API 有 joinColumns / referencedColumnNames / ownColumns；本提案不宣称 ORM 根本不支持复合 FK。当前实体以单 UUID 主键及独立 scope 字段作为 mapToPk 值，以下 FK 均引用另一组 UNIQUE 元组；未经实际 diff 证明，不把它们改成多值 relation 或重复拥有列。完整英文理由、精确原定义、deferrable/deferred 和定义 hash 见 sql-only-fks28.json。

| 表                                  | 精确约束名                         | 本地列                                                                                 | 目标表 / 列                                                                                         | 延迟          |
| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_amendment`          | `contract_amendment_id, contract_id`                                                   | `contract_amendment(id, contract_id)`                                                               | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_basis`              | `basis_snapshot_id, project_id`                                                        | `project_handover_basis_snapshot(id, project_id)`                                                   | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_contract`           | `contract_id, project_id`                                                              | `contract(id, project_id)`                                                                          | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_plan`               | `plan_version_id, contract_id, term_snapshot_id, preparation_id, readiness_package_id` | `receivable_plan_version(id, contract_id, snapshot_id, source_preparation_id, source_readiness_id)` | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_preparation`        | `preparation_id, readiness_package_id, contract_id`                                    | `contract_term_preparation(id, source_readiness_id, contract_id)`                                   | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_readiness`          | `readiness_package_id, project_id, contract_id`                                        | `contract_readiness_package(id, project_id, contract_id)`                                           | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_contract_basis`   | `fk_r4d_member_snapshot`           | `term_snapshot_id, contract_id, preparation_id`                                        | `contract_term_snapshot(id, contract_id, source_preparation_id)`                                    | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_participant_role` | `fk_r4d_role_handover`             | `handover_id, confirmation_record_id`                                                  | `project_handover(id, confirmation_record_id)`                                                      | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_participant_role` | `fk_r4d_role_person`               | `confirmation_participant_id, confirmation_record_id, participant_user_id`             | `confirmation_participant(id, confirmation_record_id, participant_id)`                              | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_summary_payload`  | `fk_r4d_payload_basis`             | `basis_snapshot_id, project_id`                                                        | `project_handover_basis_snapshot(id, project_id)`                                                   | `False/False` |
| `project_handover_summary_payload`  | `fk_r4d_payload_handover`          | `handover_id, project_id, basis_snapshot_id`                                           | `project_handover(id, project_id, basis_snapshot_id)`                                               | `False/False` |
| `contract_amendment`                | `fk_r4d_amendment_after`           | `after_snapshot_id, contract_id`                                                       | `contract_term_snapshot(id, contract_id)`                                                           | `False/False` |
| `contract_amendment`                | `fk_r4d_amendment_before`          | `before_snapshot_id, contract_id`                                                      | `contract_term_snapshot(id, contract_id)`                                                           | `False/False` |
| `contract_amendment`                | `fk_r4d_amendment_preparation`     | `source_preparation_id, source_readiness_id, contract_id`                              | `contract_term_preparation(id, source_readiness_id, contract_id)`                                   | `False/False` |
| `contract_amendment`                | `fk_r4d_amendment_project`         | `contract_id, project_id`                                                              | `contract(id, project_id)`                                                                          | `False/False` |
| `contract_amendment`                | `fk_r4d_amendment_readiness`       | `source_readiness_id, project_id, contract_id`                                         | `contract_readiness_package(id, project_id, contract_id)`                                           | `False/False` |
| `contract_amendment`                | `fk_r4d_amendment_review`          | `source_review_id, contract_id, source_preparation_id`                                 | `contract_review_binding(approval_record_id, contract_id, preparation_id)`                          | `True/True`   |
| `contract_readiness_package`        | `fk_r4d_readiness_amendment`       | `contract_amendment_id, contract_id`                                                   | `contract_amendment(id, contract_id)`                                                               | `True/True`   |
| `contract_term_preparation`         | `fk_r4d_preparation_amendment`     | `contract_amendment_id, contract_id`                                                   | `contract_amendment(id, contract_id)`                                                               | `False/False` |
| `contract_term_preparation`         | `fk_r4d_preparation_before`        | `before_snapshot_id, contract_id`                                                      | `contract_term_snapshot(id, contract_id)`                                                           | `False/False` |
| `contract_review_binding`           | `fk_r4d_review_amendment`          | `contract_amendment_id, contract_id`                                                   | `contract_amendment(id, contract_id)`                                                               | `False/False` |
| `contract_term_snapshot`            | `fk_r4d_snapshot_amendment`        | `source_amendment_id, contract_id`                                                     | `contract_amendment(id, contract_id)`                                                               | `False/False` |
| `project_handover`                  | `fk_r4d_handover_basis`            | `basis_snapshot_id, project_id`                                                        | `project_handover_basis_snapshot(id, project_id)`                                                   | `False/False` |
| `handover_baseline_impact_item`     | `fk_r4d_impact_basis_item`         | `source_basis_item_id, basis_before_id`                                                | `project_handover_basis_item(id, basis_snapshot_id)`                                                | `False/False` |
| `handover_baseline_impact_item`     | `fk_r4d_impact_rebaseline`         | `rebaseline_record_id, basis_before_id`                                                | `contract_handover_rebaseline_record(id, basis_before_id)`                                          | `False/False` |
| `project_receipt_judgment_freeze`   | `fk_r4d_receipt_freeze_basis`      | `basis_snapshot_id, project_id`                                                        | `project_handover_basis_snapshot(id, project_id)`                                                   | `False/False` |
| `project_receipt_judgment_freeze`   | `fk_r4d_receipt_freeze_handover`   | `source_handover_id, source_handover_summary_snapshot_id, basis_snapshot_id`           | `project_handover(id, summary_snapshot_id, basis_snapshot_id)`                                      | `False/False` |
| `invoice_record`                    | `fk_r4e_invoice_currency_snapshot` | `currency_source_snapshot_id, contract_id`                                             | `contract_term_snapshot(id, contract_id)`                                                           | `False/False` |

没有修改迁移检查脚本或其例外名单。Root 若无法给某项精确差异分类，schema-check 必须保持失败；本候选的静态检查不提供放行资格。
